00:00:31.940 --> 00:00:37.380
There was a young man in the center of culture at the time, that was Babylonia.

00:00:38.160 --> 00:00:50.080
Now, for you to understand, Babylonia at the time, not only was the most advanced culture in the ancient world,

00:00:50.520 --> 00:00:57.180
but in many respects, it was so advanced, say in the fields of mathematics and astronomy,

00:00:57.360 --> 00:01:00.320
