about a hundred years ago

00:01:07.520 --> 00:01:09.600
they used to write in tablets

00:01:09.600 --> 00:01:11.300
they used to write in tablets

00:01:11.300 --> 00:01:13.960
and after they write in the tablets they beg them

00:01:13.960 --> 00:01:16.000
that's the way they used to write

00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:17.440
and those tablets

00:01:17.440 --> 00:01:20.080
