01:24:22.380 --> 01:24:25.040
these weapons designed for

01:24:25.040 --> 01:24:29.420
could it be that the State Department

01:24:29.420 --> 01:24:30.640
wanted to

01:24:30.640 --> 01:24:31.640
have

01:24:31.640 --> 01:24:41.640
Iraq, the master of the atomic bomb of chemical and biological weapons, to use it against another Iran?

01:24:41.640 --> 01:24:50.640
Of course not. So who is supposed to be the target of those weapons?

01:24:50.640 --> 01:25:02.640
Now we understand one of the most shameful episodes in American justice history.

01:25:02.640 --> 01:25:07.640
The Pollock case. Do you know what was the sin of Pollock?

01:25:07.640 --> 01:25:16.640
Because he told the Israelis about the atomic bomb and that this atomic bomb was financed by the United States of America.

01:25:16.640 --> 01:25:26.640
in America voted against Israel at the United Nations because Israel destroyed the atomic bomb.

01:25:28.640 --> 01:25:35.640
And who was the vice president then? And who was the one who cast the vote at the United Nations against Israel?

01:25:36.640 --> 01:25:42.640
Let us not forget, nor forgive. Let us not forget, nor forgive.

01:25:46.640 --> 01:25:49.040
This is faith.

01:25:50.240 --> 01:25:51.120
Faith.

01:25:51.760 --> 01:25:52.040
Faith.

01:25:53.720 --> 01:25:54.320
Amen.

01:25:54.320 --> 01:25:55.320
Amen.

01:25:55.520 --> 01:25:56.660
Amen.

01:26:16.640 --> 01:26:46.620
Thank you.

01:26:46.640 --> 01:27:16.620
Thank you.

